{"title":"Magma Cave Shop","slug":"Magma_Cave_Shop","hero":{"file":"Magma_Cave_Shop.webp","width":400,"height":200},"pageid":2440,"revid":17547,"timestamp":"2025-03-10T13:01:55Z","lastEditor":"Blatnoykot","categories":["Stubs","Locations","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"NPC","value":"Raffina Caldera"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.52.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"15/03/2024"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"secrets","text":"Secrets"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Magma Cave Shop</b> is a store located high up in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magma_Caves/\">Magma Caves</a>. The store's location is pretty tricky to get to. \n</p><p>From the left side of the main magma tree area, there's an area to go up. If you follow that path, then you will stumble upon the entrance to the <b>Magma Cave Shop.</b>\n</p><p>\nThe store is run by an NPC called <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Raffina_Caldera/\">Raffina Caldera</a>.</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Picture of the magma tree area, a red arrow showing where the Magma Cave Shop is located.\">Picture of the magma tree area, a red arrow showing where the Magma Cave Shop is located.</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Picture of the magma tree area, a red arrow showing where the Magma Cave Shop is located.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Boxed_Lava/\">Boxed Lava</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Boxed Lava\">Boxed Lava</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$5,280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Obsidian_Skull/\">Obsidian Skull</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Obsidian Skull\">Obsidian Skull</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$200,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lava_Lantern/\">Lava Lantern</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lava lantern Unboxed\">Lava lantern Unboxed</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lava lantern Unboxed\">Lava lantern Unboxed</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fire_Potion/\">Fire Potion</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Fire Potion\">Fire Potion</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$15,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Molten_Moai/\">Molten Moai</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Molten Moai\">Molten Moai</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$7,980\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Goblin_Memorabilia/\">Goblin Memorabilia</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Goblin Memorabilia\">Goblin Memorabilia</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$75,000\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"secrets\">Secrets</h2>\n<p>If you look closely you'll find a few <b>Greedy Greeb Goblins</b> hidden around the room. One of them stands on the entrance of a small hole on the ceiling. Entering this hole leads to the Goblin Memorabilia, and another path above, to which the item can be brought back down the shop.\n</p>"}
